<title>HUNGARY: Central Europe's CESI index falls.</title>
<headline>Central Europe's CESI index falls.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index fell on Monday to end at 1,491.48 points, down 13.61 points, the Budapest Stock Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index lost ground as most shares in the share basket declined.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, reflects trends of 50 shares on the Budapest, Prague and Warsaw bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
